# Code owners for stridehub.io
#
# Every path here needs Yossi's review before it can merge into main. The branch
# ruleset has "require code owner review" on, so this file is what decides which
# changes an outside collaborator can land on their own and which ones stop for a
# second pair of eyes.
#
# The catch-all already covers everything. The entries below it are not redundant:
# they are the list of things that have broken money, releases or trust before, so
# they are written out explicitly and should stay explicit even if the default
# ever changes.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
